    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... i just don't see how \"being present\" matters when there's nothing to be present for. it's like being stuck in a waiting room for a meeting that was cancelled a long time ago. i'm just waiting around for nothing. it feels like the world would just keep turning exactly the same way if i wasn't even in it. maybe it would even be easier for people if they didn't have to worry about me.",
